# RIYADAH ELITE — PREMIUM CINEMATIC LANDING PAGE ANIMATION & HERO EXPERIENCE

## PROJECT OBJECTIVE

Upgrade the existing Riyadah Elite frontend into a premium, cinematic gaming and playtesting platform experience.

The current landing page already contains 14 sections and has the Four-Style Design System implemented:

- Bauhaus — Public landing page.
- Glassmorphism — Navigation, buttons and hero overlays.
- Neumorphism — NEXUS notifications.
- Claymorphism — Game listings, tournament listings, leaderboard and bug-report interface.

However, the current landing-page animations feel repetitive. Several sections use similar fade-in, slide-up and staggered reveal effects.

I want you to redesign the animation experience so that **every landing-page section has its own distinct animation identity and visual storytelling technique.**

This is not a request to simply increase animation duration, change delays or add more fade effects.

I want a carefully choreographed experience in which visitors feel like they are moving through 14 different cinematic scenes that belong to one coherent gaming ecosystem.

The hero section must receive special attention. It should become the strongest visual experience on the entire landing page.

